<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY 1-MTH BUBOR RATE FLAT, 3-MTH, 6-MTH DROPS.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY 1-MTH BUBOR RATE FLAT, 3-MTH, 6-MTH DROPS.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rate (BUBOR) was steady on Thursday for the one-month maturity, and eased for three and six months, the National Bank of Hungary said.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was fixed at 20.75 percent, unchanged, the three-month rate at 20.44 percent, down 0.05 while the six-month rate was set at 19.95 percent, down 0.13.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
